Wi-Fi Sign-in
-------------
This fork adds a captive-portal sign-in mode ("Wi-Fi Sign-in") to rmweb 0.9.7
(MIT, exp78; see LICENSE). The upstream project is
https://github.com/exp78/rmweb. Some pieces of the sign-in mode are ported from
jhasubhash/rmbrowser (https://github.com/jhasubhash/rmbrowser) — MIT. Those
pieces remain under their original MIT license and copyright:
